{"seq":1,"slug":"sampling-signal-stack-unwinding-model","title":"采样剖析的信号模型与栈展开原理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/performance-engineering/continuous-profiling-flamegraph-performance-engineering/profiling-signal-sampling-model/sampling-signal-stack-unwinding-model","wordCount":2857,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"采样剖析的信号模型与栈展开原理\">采样剖析的信号模型与栈展开原理</h1><p>采样剖析（sampling profiler）的可靠性不取决于它报告了多少条火焰图，而取决于两条底层事实链：<strong>内核以什么模型把「此刻正在执行的指令地址」交到采集器手里</strong>，以及<strong>采集器如何从这一个地址反向走出一整条调用栈</strong>。这两条链决定剖析数据的分辨率上限——一旦信号被合并、栈被截断，后续的火焰图聚合与差分都只是在放大失真。本文拆开讲清这两条链，并说明样本如何落成 pprof / OTel Profiles 数据模型。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-剖析器在时间轴上抽样-而非持续观测\">核心概念：剖析器在时间轴上抽样，而非持续观测</h2><p>剖析的本质是<strong>用一个低开销的持续行为去估计一个高开销的瞬时分布</strong>。CPU 在纳秒级粒度上不断切换指令指针（IP）与栈指针（SP）。剖析器无法记录每一次跳转（那是全量追踪，开销不可接受），于是按固定周期打断执行、记录当刻的 IP/SP，再用这些离散快照估计「哪些函数占用了多少 CPU 时间」。</p>\n<p>这个估计成立的前提有两个：<strong>抽样在时间上近似均匀</strong>，且<strong>每个样本能还原出完整的调用路径</strong>。前者由信号模型保证，后者由栈展开保证。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[配置采样周期 period] --&gt; B[内核定时器 / perf_event 到期]&#10;  B --&gt; C{样本归属哪个线程}&#10;  C --&gt;|per-thread timer| D[向目标线程投递信号 SIGPROF]&#10;  C --&gt;|perf_event_open| E[内核写 ring buffer 记录 IP SP]&#10;  D --&gt; F[信号处理器取当刻 IP SP]&#10;  E --&gt; G[用户态或 eBPF 读取记录]&#10;  F --&gt; H[栈展开: FP / DWARF CFI / ORC]&#10;  G --&gt; H&#10;  H --&gt; I[符号化: 地址到函数名与行号]&#10;  I --&gt; J[聚合为 pprof / OTel Profiles 样本]&#10;  J --&gt; K[火焰图与差分]\">flowchart TD\n  A[配置采样周期 period] --&gt; B[内核定时器 / perf_event 到期]\n  B --&gt; C{样本归属哪个线程}\n  C --&gt;|per-thread timer| D[向目标线程投递信号 SIGPROF]\n  C --&gt;|perf_event_open| E[内核写 ring buffer 记录 IP SP]\n  D --&gt; F[信号处理器取当刻 IP SP]\n  E --&gt; G[用户态或 eBPF 读取记录]\n  F --&gt; H[栈展开: FP / DWARF CFI / ORC]\n  G --&gt; H\n  H --&gt; I[符号化: 地址到函数名与行号]\n  I --&gt; J[聚合为 pprof / OTel Profiles 样本]\n  J --&gt; K[火焰图与差分]</pre><p>两种采集路径的关键差异：<strong>信号投递（signal-based）</strong> 把采样交给内核定时器和标准信号机制；<strong>内核缓冲（perf/eBPF）</strong> 把采样完全放在内核里用环形缓冲区承载。下表给出它们在模型层面的分工。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>信号投递（SIGPROF + timer_create）</th>\n<th>内核事件（perf_event_open / eBPF）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>采样触发者</td>\n<td>内核 POSIX 定时器</td>\n<td>内核 perf 计数器溢出</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>样本携带内容</td>\n<td>处理器内取 IP/SP，需自行展开</td>\n<td>内核直接记录 IP/SP，可含环形缓冲</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>线程归属性</td>\n<td>每线程独立定时器（<code>CLOCK_THREAD_CPUTIME_ID</code>）</td>\n<td>可 per-task、per-cpu 或 cgroup 级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>采到内核栈</td>\n<td>默认否（用户态信号）</td>\n<td>可（内核栈 + 用户栈联合展开）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>开销控制</td>\n<td>依赖信号处理器尽量精简</td>\n<td>依赖环形缓冲采样率与 bpf 程序复杂度</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p>事实锚点：pprof 的 profile 格式是 gzip 压缩的 <code>profile.proto</code>，官方描述为「描述一组调用栈及符号化信息」，每个 sample 指向一条 location 层次上的位置，并携带一个或多个数值与可选标签（<a href=\"https://github.com/google/pprof/blob/main/doc/README.md\">google/pprof README</a>）。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"信号模型-周期-定时器与-信号不排队-的陷阱\">信号模型：周期、定时器与「信号不排队」的陷阱</h2><p>信号剖析的核心参数是<strong>采样周期</strong>（period），通常写作频率的倒数。若采样频率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span> Hz，周期 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T = 1/f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span> 秒。一个时长 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 的剖析，期望样本数近似为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>≈</mo><mi>D</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N \\approx D \\cdot f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>例如 100 Hz 剖析采集 30 秒，期望约 3000 个样本——这是置信区间计算的基础。</p>\n<p>Linux 上实现周期触发有两代机制。早期用 <code>setitimer(ITIMER_PROF, ...)</code>：按<strong>进程的用户态 + 内核态 CPU 时间</strong>递减，到期投递 <code>SIGPROF</code>。缺陷是进程级、精度受 tick 限制，多线程程序里信号会自动投递到「未屏蔽该信号」的任一线程，样本归属不确定。现代做法用 <code>timer_create</code> 配合 <code>CLOCK_THREAD_CPUTIME_ID</code>，为<strong>每个线程</strong>建独立定时器，信号精确落到产生 CPU 时间的那个线程上——这正是 Go 运行时与多数现代剖析器采用 per-thread 定时器的原因。</p>\n<p>信号模型有一个反直觉但决定性的约束：<strong>POSIX 标准信号不排队</strong>。同一信号在上一次尚未处理完时再次产生，内核只保留一个待处理实例，后续同名信号被合并丢失。后果有二：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>信号处理器必须极短</strong>。处理器若做重活（符号化、加锁、分配内存），处理窗口变长，期间到期的采样被合并，样本数低于期望值——CPU 使用被系统性低估。</li>\n<li><strong>异步信号安全（async-signal-safe）</strong>。处理器内只能调用可重入且不持锁的函数；<code>malloc</code>、<code>printf</code>、多数 C++ 标准库调用都不可用。因此采集器通常在处理器里只做「抓 IP/SP 到预分配缓冲」，把展开与符号化推迟到采样之外。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>不可靠信号还会带来<strong>采样偏差（sampling bias）</strong>：被合并的样本不是随机丢失，而是集中在「信号处理开销大」或「频繁进出内核」的时刻。观测结果时，应把「实际样本数 vs 期望样本数」当作健康指标——偏离过大说明采样链在某处被压缩了。</p>\n<h2 id=\"栈展开-从单个-ip-sp-还原调用路径\">栈展开：从单个 IP/SP 还原调用路径</h2><p>采集器拿到的只是一对寄存器值，而火焰图需要一整条调用链。把这个点扩展成链的过程叫<strong>栈展开（stack unwinding）</strong>。主流有三条路线，代价与可靠性各异。</p>\n<p><strong>帧指针链（frame pointer unwinding）</strong> 最快。编译器在函数序言把调用者的栈帧基址存入寄存器（x86-64 上是 <code>RBP</code>），形成一条 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>B</mi><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>→</mo><mi>R</mi><mi>B</mi><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>→</mo><mo>…</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">RBP_0 \\to RBP_1 \\to \\dots</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.123em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span></span></span></span></span> 的链表；展开时沿链回溯、每步读取返回地址即可。代价是<strong>要求编译器保留帧指针</strong>。优化编译常见的 <code>-fomit-frame-pointer</code> 把 <code>RBP</code> 释放为通用寄存器，链断裂，展开得到的栈往往戛然而止或错乱——这是「同一个程序，<code>-O2</code> 下火焰图变浅」的根因。</p>\n<p><strong>DWARF CFI（call frame information）</strong> 是精确方案。编译器在 <code>.eh_frame</code>（运行时异常展开用）与 <code>.debug_frame</code>（调试用）里生成描述「每个 PC 处如何恢复各寄存器」的规则表；<code>libunwind</code>、<code>libgcc</code> 的 unwind 后端据此逐步回退。它不依赖帧指针，栈完整，但需读取伴随二进制发布或单独提供的展开信息，性能低于 FP 链。</p>\n<p><strong>ORC（Oops Rewind Capability）</strong> 是 Linux 内核自 4.14 起采用的方案，把内核所有函数的展开规则预编译成紧凑的 <code>.orc_unwind</code> 表，取代内核里的 DWARF 解析。今天 eBPF 采集内核栈时，ORC 是默认路径。</p>\n<p>无论哪条路线，都有几个共同边界条件会在火焰图里留下痕迹：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>信号帧是特殊帧</strong>。信号处理器由内核插入一个「sigreturn 蹦床」（glibc 里是 <code>__restore_rt</code>）作为返回地址，展开器必须识别并跳过，否则调用链里会出现伪造的系统帧。</li>\n<li><strong>栈顶截断</strong>。展开有最大深度限制，超过则停止，火焰图表现为「平顶」——这是采样器的保护措施，不是程序真的扁平。</li>\n<li><strong>叶子帧与内联</strong>。最内层函数若被内联，展开只能还原到其外层函数；符号化阶段需要 DWARF 内联信息才能把行号映射回真正被内联的源函数。</li>\n</ul>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>展开方案</th>\n<th>依赖</th>\n<th>速度</th>\n<th>需关闭 <code>-fomit-frame-pointer</code>?</th>\n<th>典型场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>帧指针链</td>\n<td><code>RBP</code></td>\n<td>最快</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>早期信号剖析、低开销连续采集</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DWARF CFI</td>\n<td><code>.eh_frame</code> 展开表</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>精度优先的用户态剖析</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ORC</td>\n<td><code>.orc_unwind</code> 表</td>\n<td>快</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>Linux 内核栈 / eBPF 采集</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>eBPF 辅助展开</td>\n<td>内核 bpf 程序</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>视实现</td>\n<td>现代零侵入连续剖析</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p>事实锚点：OTel Profiles 数据模型直接建立在 pprof protobuf 格式之上，栈轨迹通过 pprof 风格的 Mappings / Locations / Functions 表示；样本可携带含 trace 与 span ID 的 Link 以关联 trace/span，并用「广义字典」对重复消息去重以降体积。该信号在 OpenTelemetry 规范中标记为 <strong>Alpha</strong>（<a href=\"https://opentelemetry.io/docs/specs/otel/profiles/\">OpenTelemetry Profiles 规范</a>）。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"统计模型-样本数决定你能分辨多小的差异\">统计模型：样本数决定你能分辨多小的差异</h2><p>采样剖析的结论是<strong>估计量</strong>，不是真值。若某函数真实占用 CPU 比例为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span>，则采到该函数的样本数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span></span></span></span></span> 服从二项分布 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi><mo>∼</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X \\sim B(N, p)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，其估计 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>X</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{p} = X/N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 的标准误为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mi>N</mi></mfrac></msqrt><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mtext>95% 置信区间</mtext><mo>≈</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>±</mo><mn>1.96</mn><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mi>N</mi></mfrac></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{SE}(\\hat{p}) = \\sqrt{\\frac{p(1-p)}{N}}, \\qquad \\text{95\\% 置信区间} \\approx \\hat{p} \\pm 1.96\\sqrt{\\frac{p(1-p)}{N}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">SE</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.44em;vertical-align:-0.7356em;\"></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.7044em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-4.4em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.4em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:1em;\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.6644em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.4em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:1.02em;height:2.48em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"2.48em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 2592\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M424,2478\nc-1.3,-0.7,-38.5,-172,-111.5,-514c-73,-342,-109.8,-513.3,-110.5,-514\nc0,-2,-10.7,14.3,-32,49c-4.7,7.3,-9.8,15.7,-15.5,25c-5.7,9.3,-9.8,16,-12.5,20\ns-5,7,-5,7c-4,-3.3,-8.3,-7.7,-13,-13s-13,-13,-13,-13s76,-122,76,-122s77,-121,77,-121\ns209,968,209,968c0,-2,84.7,-361.7,254,-1079c169.3,-717.3,254.7,-1077.7,256,-1081\nl0 -0c4,-6.7,10,-10,18,-10 H400000\nv40H1014.6\ns-87.3,378.7,-272.6,1166c-185.3,787.3,-279.3,1182.3,-282,1185\nc-2,6,-10,9,-24,9\nc-8,0,-12,-0.7,-12,-2z M1001 80\nh400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7356em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">95% </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">置信区间</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">±</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.44em;vertical-align:-0.7356em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.96</span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.7044em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-4.4em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.4em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:1em;\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.6644em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.4em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:1.02em;height:2.48em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"2.48em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 2592\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M424,2478\nc-1.3,-0.7,-38.5,-172,-111.5,-514c-73,-342,-109.8,-513.3,-110.5,-514\nc0,-2,-10.7,14.3,-32,49c-4.7,7.3,-9.8,15.7,-15.5,25c-5.7,9.3,-9.8,16,-12.5,20\ns-5,7,-5,7c-4,-3.3,-8.3,-7.7,-13,-13s-13,-13,-13,-13s76,-122,76,-122s77,-121,77,-121\ns209,968,209,968c0,-2,84.7,-361.7,254,-1079c169.3,-717.3,254.7,-1077.7,256,-1081\nl0 -0c4,-6.7,10,-10,18,-10 H400000\nv40H1014.6\ns-87.3,378.7,-272.6,1166c-185.3,787.3,-279.3,1182.3,-282,1185\nc-2,6,-10,9,-24,9\nc-8,0,-12,-0.7,-12,-2z M1001 80\nh400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7356em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这解释了两件事。其一，若某函数占 10% CPU（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p=0.1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.1</span></span></span></span></span>）而只有 300 个样本，半宽约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1.96</mn><msqrt><mrow><mn>0.1</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>0.9</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>300</mn></mrow></msqrt><mo>≈</mo><mn>3.4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1.96\\sqrt{0.1 \\times 0.9 / 300} \\approx 3.4\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.24em;vertical-align:-0.305em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.96</span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.935em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3.2em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:1em;\"><span class=\"mord\">0.1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.9/300</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.895em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:1.02em;height:1.28em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.28em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1296\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M263,681c0.7,0,18,39.7,52,119\nc34,79.3,68.167,158.7,102.5,238c34.3,79.3,51.8,119.3,52.5,120\nc340,-704.7,510.7,-1060.3,512,-1067\nl0 -0\nc4.7,-7.3,11,-11,19,-11\nH40000v40H1012.3\ns-271.3,567,-271.3,567c-38.7,80.7,-84,175,-136,283c-52,108,-89.167,185.3,-111.5,232\nc-22.3,46.7,-33.8,70.3,-34.5,71c-4.7,4.7,-12.3,7,-23,7s-12,-1,-12,-1\ns-109,-253,-109,-253c-72.7,-168,-109.3,-252,-110,-252c-10.7,8,-22,16.7,-34,26\nc-22,17.3,-33.3,26,-34,26s-26,-26,-26,-26s76,-59,76,-59s76,-60,76,-60z\nM1001 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.305em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3.4%</span></span></span></span></span>——10% 与 13% 在统计上不可区分；要把半宽压到 ±1%，需约 3457 个样本，以 100 Hz 计约 35 秒。<strong>想在火焰图差分里看出 1 个百分点的回归，采样量必须达到数千样本级。</strong> 其二，两次采样有各自独立的偏差：版本 A 用 99 Hz、B 用 100 Hz，或时长不同，样本基数不同，直接比较绝对值会得到伪回归。正确做法是先把样本归一化为「占比」再比较占比之差，把置信区间叠加为误差带，只把超出误差带的差异当作真实变化。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从原始样本到-profile-数据模型\">从原始样本到 profile 数据模型</h2><p>采集与展开产出的是「一堆 (栈, 数值) 对」，需要落成可聚合、可差分的结构化模型。pprof 的 <code>profile.proto</code> 是事实标准：用 <strong>ValueType / SampleType 表</strong>声明每列数值的含义（如 <code>samples/count</code> 与 <code>cpu/nanoseconds</code>），用 <strong>Mapping 表</strong>记录可执行映像与构建 ID，用 <strong>Location 表</strong>（地址与行号）与 <strong>Function 表</strong>（函数名、文件名）构成符号化的两级结构，每个 Sample 通过一组 <code>location_id</code> 引用一条调用链。profile 顶部还带 <code>period</code> 与 <code>period_type</code> 字段，显式记录「每个样本代表多少时间」——这是采样剖析在数据模型里的自描述，让下游工具在不同采样率间正确换算。</p>\n<p>OTel Profiles 在此之上做三件扩展：把 profile 批次与 Resource、InstrumentationScope 绑定；为样本增加指向 trace/span 的 Link 以关联剖析与追踪；用广义字典统一去重。其目标是与 pprof 无损互转，遇到无法无损转换的源数据（如 JFR、linux_perf）时用 <code>original_payload_format</code> 保留原始载荷（<a href=\"https://opentelemetry.io/docs/specs/otel/profiles/\">OpenTelemetry Profiles 规范</a>）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>profile 结构</th>\n<th>承载什么</th>\n<th>与采样理论的对应</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>ValueType / SampleType</td>\n<td>每列数值的名称与单位</td>\n<td>区分「样本计数」与「换算后的 CPU 时间」</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>period / period_type</td>\n<td>每样本代表的时间/事件数</td>\n<td>采样周期的自描述，跨采样率换算的依据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mapping</td>\n<td>可执行映像、构建 ID</td>\n<td>符号化时定位到正确的二进制版本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Location + Function</td>\n<td>地址、行号、函数名</td>\n<td>展开所得调用链的符号化结果</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Sample.LocationId</td>\n<td>一条调用链的地址序列</td>\n<td>栈展开输出的直接编码</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>采样剖析用周期性抽样估计 CPU 时间分布；<strong>信号模型</strong>决定样本从哪来、是否归属正确线程，<strong>栈展开</strong>决定样本能否还原为完整调用链——任一断裂，后续聚合与差分都在失真上放大。</li>\n<li>现代实现偏好 per-thread 的 <code>timer_create</code> + <code>CLOCK_THREAD_CPUTIME_ID</code>，而非进程级 <code>setitimer(ITIMER_PROF)</code>；样本必须精确归属到产生 CPU 时间的线程。</li>\n<li>POSIX 标准信号<strong>不排队</strong>，处理器内的重活会导致采样被合并丢失并带来结构性偏差；处理器必须异步信号安全且极短。</li>\n<li>栈展开三条路线各有取舍：帧指针链最快但怕 <code>-fomit-frame-pointer</code>；DWARF CFI 精确但需展开表；ORC 是内核侧紧凑方案。信号帧、深度截断与内联是常见失真来源。</li>\n<li>样本数是分辨率的硬约束：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>≈</mo><mi>D</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N \\approx D \\cdot f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span>，95% 置信半宽 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≈</mo><mn>1.96</mn><msqrt><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\approx 1.96\\sqrt{p(1-p)/N}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4831em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.24em;vertical-align:-0.305em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.96</span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.935em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3.2em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:1em;\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.895em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:1.02em;height:1.28em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.28em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1296\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M263,681c0.7,0,18,39.7,52,119\nc34,79.3,68.167,158.7,102.5,238c34.3,79.3,51.8,119.3,52.5,120\nc340,-704.7,510.7,-1060.3,512,-1067\nl0 -0\nc4.7,-7.3,11,-11,19,-11\nH40000v40H1012.3\ns-271.3,567,-271.3,567c-38.7,80.7,-84,175,-136,283c-52,108,-89.167,185.3,-111.5,232\nc-22.3,46.7,-33.8,70.3,-34.5,71c-4.7,4.7,-12.3,7,-23,7s-12,-1,-12,-1\ns-109,-253,-109,-253c-72.7,-168,-109.3,-252,-110,-252c-10.7,8,-22,16.7,-34,26\nc-22,17.3,-33.3,26,-34,26s-26,-26,-26,-26s76,-59,76,-59s76,-60,76,-60z\nM1001 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.305em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>；分辨 1 个百分点差异需数千样本。</li>\n<li>pprof 的 <code>profile.proto</code> 以 ValueType/period/Location/Function 自描述采样语义；OTel Profiles（当前 Alpha）在其上叠加 Resource、trace Link 与字典去重，并支持与 pprof 无损互转。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"采样剖析的信号模型与栈展开原理","id":"采样剖析的信号模型与栈展开原理"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：剖析器在时间轴上抽样，而非持续观测","id":"核心概念-剖析器在时间轴上抽样-而非持续观测"},{"level":2,"text":"信号模型：周期、定时器与「信号不排队」的陷阱","id":"信号模型-周期-定时器与-信号不排队-的陷阱"},{"level":2,"text":"栈展开：从单个 IP/SP 还原调用路径","id":"栈展开-从单个-ip-sp-还原调用路径"},{"level":2,"text":"统计模型：样本数决定你能分辨多小的差异","id":"统计模型-样本数决定你能分辨多小的差异"},{"level":2,"text":"从原始样本到 profile 数据模型","id":"从原始样本到-profile-数据模型"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"采样偏差来源与统计显著性建模","url":"/l-doc-books/h/performance-engineering/continuous-profiling-flamegraph-performance-engineering/profiling-signal-sampling-model/statistical-bias-significance-model"}}